      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16867\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16867\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e. The calculator gives the values of the negative powers of 2 as:\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e0.2, 0.04, 0.008, 0.0016, 0.00032, 0.000064, 0.000013 (actually 0.0000128), ...\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-17 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_2_1_integers_10_10/f-10-10-9.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
